== Deliverables
<sec:intro_deliverables>

The source code and the report of this project have been released into the public domain#footnote[CC0 1.0 Universal: #link("https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/")] and are made available on GitHub at #link("https://github.com/decomp/decomp") and #link("https://github.com/decomp/doc").

The following document has been produced:

- Project report; see objective~@itm:obj_review_decomp_techniques and~@itm:obj_review_suitable_ir

And the following system artefacts have been developed:

- Library for interacting with LLVM IR (#emph[work in progress]); see objective~@itm:obj_ir_library \ #link("https://github.com/llir/llvm")

- Control flow graph generation tool; see objective~@itm:obj_control_flow_analysis_component

- Subgraph isomorphism search algorithms and related tools; see objective~@itm:obj_control_flow_analysis_component

- Control flow recovery tool; see objective~@itm:obj_decomp_pass_tool

- Go code generation tool (#emph[proof of concept]); see objective~@itm:obj_decomp_pass_tool

- Go post-processing tool; see objective~@itm:obj_decomp_pass_tool
